WEBVTT

01:49.570 --> 01:54.950
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.100 --> 01:58.030
[Episode 22]

01:58.120 --> 01:58.920
Li Shiliu,

01:59.680 --> 02:01.230
the capital prefecture's office is handling a case.

02:01.230 --> 02:02.590
How dare you obstruct us?

02:02.590 --> 02:05.320
So what if it's the capital prefecture's office?

02:05.790 --> 02:07.320
Without my approval today,

02:08.110 --> 02:09.639
you won't take anyone away.

02:09.710 --> 02:11.970
What if I insist on taking him away today?

02:18.360 --> 02:20.120
You're welcome to try.

02:22.520 --> 02:24.200
[Big Fortune]

02:40.310 --> 02:41.120
Li Shiliu,

02:42.590 --> 02:43.710
I'm taking him back

02:44.030 --> 02:45.590
to investigate an old case.

02:45.980 --> 02:47.860
If he isn't Shangguan Baihe,

02:47.940 --> 02:49.660
I will release him.

02:50.150 --> 02:51.570
But if he is—

02:52.140 --> 02:53.070
sorry—

02:54.410 --> 02:55.480
next time I come,

02:56.090 --> 02:58.030
I'll hold the entire Waning River Crescent

02:58.030 --> 03:00.290
accountable for sheltering a criminal.

03:07.080 --> 03:07.910
Everyone, please calm down.

03:07.910 --> 03:08.840
Calm down.

03:10.220 --> 03:11.450
It's alright, Chief.

03:12.310 --> 03:13.790
The innocent have nothing to fear.

03:13.790 --> 03:15.000
Since I'm innocent,

03:15.020 --> 03:17.020
what harm is there in going with him?

03:21.520 --> 03:22.780
I'll leave Song Yiting

03:24.010 --> 03:24.900
to you.

03:29.520 --> 03:30.329
Let's go.

03:37.810 --> 03:43.400
[Script Rule]

03:39.790 --> 03:41.400
The fall into the royal garden's water,

03:41.400 --> 03:42.950
the rescue during the Lantern Festival,

03:42.950 --> 03:44.960
and the family feud over foraging wild vegetables—

03:44.960 --> 03:46.520
all these events have already happened.

03:46.260 --> 03:51.320
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

03:47.710 --> 03:49.000
If all

03:49.360 --> 03:51.090
the iconic scenes in the script

03:51.590 --> 03:53.079
can't be skipped,

03:53.990 --> 03:55.930
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

03:54.190 --> 03:55.320
then the next one is…

03:55.980 --> 03:58.400
[4. Betrayed by Her Own Sister and Husband]

03:58.310 --> 03:59.120
Miss Yimeng!

03:59.400 --> 04:00.240
Miss Yimeng!

04:01.970 --> 04:02.840
Yinzhu?

04:04.030 --> 04:04.870
What's the matter?

04:04.870 --> 04:06.620
Miss Yiting is in trouble.

04:07.150 --> 04:08.400
What happened to Yiting?

04:08.400 --> 04:09.310
It's Madam.

04:09.400 --> 04:10.770
She invited a matchmaker to the house

04:10.770 --> 04:13.000
and insisted on getting Miss Yiting's birthdate to arrange a marriage for her.

04:13.000 --> 04:15.150
Miss Yiting refused and argued with her.

04:15.150 --> 04:17.360
Madam got angry and threatened to confine her.

04:17.360 --> 04:18.690
But Miss Yiting said...

04:19.310 --> 04:20.040
Just tell me!

04:20.040 --> 04:21.040
What did she say?

04:21.360 --> 04:23.040
She said everyone's forcing her to be a puppet,

04:23.040 --> 04:25.040
but she's determined to fight for herself this time.

04:25.040 --> 04:26.270
She said she wants to make things irreversible

04:26.270 --> 04:28.270
and break Madam's hope completely.

04:28.780 --> 04:30.180
She's planning to elope!

04:34.310 --> 04:35.120
General,

04:35.360 --> 04:37.680
whether Shangguan Baihe is real or not,

04:37.830 --> 04:39.560
we'll pin it on Waning River Crescent

04:39.560 --> 04:43.020
and teach these nobodies from the martial arts world a lesson.

05:31.720 --> 05:33.180
I've brought your things.

05:33.870 --> 05:34.930
Where's the blade?

05:36.150 --> 05:37.600
Is this the last thing

05:37.600 --> 05:39.120
you want to say to me?

05:41.680 --> 05:42.680
On the way here,

05:42.870 --> 05:43.870
I was wondering

05:45.000 --> 05:47.200
if you wanted to see me one last time.

05:50.000 --> 05:51.040
Now I see

05:51.870 --> 05:53.670
it was just my wishful thinking.

06:11.260 --> 06:12.480
What Nan Rui said

06:12.500 --> 06:13.830
was taught to him by you.

06:15.530 --> 06:16.500
Every word

06:16.570 --> 06:18.050
reflected how you see me.

06:20.830 --> 06:22.870
But I want you to tell me yourself

06:23.120 --> 06:24.150
what you really

06:24.400 --> 06:25.930
think of me.

06:30.260 --> 06:31.790
This is our last meeting.

06:32.180 --> 06:33.659
From now on, no more news,

06:33.690 --> 06:34.860
no more encounters.

06:38.560 --> 06:39.890
I can give you the blade,

06:40.870 --> 06:43.800
but I want you to be honest with me one last time.

06:56.600 --> 06:57.270
What's going on?

06:57.270 --> 06:58.190
Shangguan He,

06:58.360 --> 07:00.490
something's happened to Song Yiting!

07:00.870 --> 07:01.830
Where is Mr. Li?

07:03.160 --> 07:04.970
Take me to him quickly.

07:05.270 --> 07:06.720
Yiting went to see Nan Heng.

07:06.720 --> 07:07.840
She's in danger!

07:09.480 --> 07:12.190
Bring Shangguan He back to the capital prefecture's office.

07:12.190 --> 07:13.270
Zijin Pavilion

07:13.870 --> 07:16.430
is where I came with my father as a child.

07:16.920 --> 07:18.920
It's where my father

07:19.430 --> 07:21.690
and Yimeng's mother pledged their love.

07:23.630 --> 07:24.430
That day,

07:24.920 --> 07:26.520
it was also snowing heavily.

07:27.240 --> 07:28.770
I didn't listen to my father

07:28.830 --> 07:30.230
and wait in the corridor;

07:31.040 --> 07:32.800
I sneaked into the hall.

07:33.790 --> 07:34.800
Unexpectedly,

07:35.610 --> 07:37.460
I saw my father crying.

07:39.070 --> 07:41.000
Since I was old enough to remember things,

07:41.000 --> 07:42.480
my mother told me

07:43.040 --> 07:45.700
Yimeng's mother came from a humble background.

07:45.920 --> 07:46.950
But that day,

07:47.310 --> 07:49.110
I was curious for the first time—

07:49.600 --> 07:51.570
what kind of love

07:52.390 --> 07:54.760
could make a proud Minister of War

07:55.190 --> 07:57.159
hold his late wife's memorial tablet

07:57.159 --> 07:58.630
in this broken house

07:59.120 --> 08:00.520
and cry uncontrollably?

08:01.160 --> 08:03.020
I understand what you're saying.

08:03.160 --> 08:03.950
You want to find someone

08:03.950 --> 08:05.430
like your father.

08:06.800 --> 08:07.680
But Miss Song,

08:08.240 --> 08:10.170
can we talk about this another day?

08:12.270 --> 08:14.040
Without a soulmate,

08:14.310 --> 08:16.240
wandering the world alone is fine.

08:16.740 --> 08:18.120
But after meeting you,

08:18.390 --> 08:19.340
I feel that

08:19.720 --> 08:22.250
spending time with you

08:22.600 --> 08:24.000
would be a good thing.

08:25.270 --> 08:26.120
Mr. Li,

08:26.800 --> 08:27.830
I don't know

08:28.240 --> 08:29.830
what I like about you.

08:30.390 --> 08:33.049
Maybe I just don't want to enter a blind marriage

08:33.120 --> 08:34.720
with someone I don't love.

08:37.240 --> 08:38.400
That man

08:38.789 --> 08:40.549
matches my status,

08:40.840 --> 08:43.030
but it's only a match of status.

08:47.440 --> 08:49.080
Having witnessed true love,

08:50.270 --> 08:51.930
how could one settle for less?

08:53.890 --> 08:54.700
Mr. Li,

08:55.790 --> 08:57.600
are you the one I should wait for?

09:05.750 --> 09:06.550
Miss Song,

09:07.200 --> 09:07.960
I can't

09:07.960 --> 09:09.360
give you an answer today.

09:09.550 --> 09:10.410
How about this?

09:11.320 --> 09:12.440
Wait a few more days,

09:12.440 --> 09:14.570
and I believe you'll find your answer.

09:15.870 --> 09:17.400
What if I don't want to wait?

09:19.750 --> 09:20.550
I'm sorry.

09:37.240 --> 09:38.240
It's the incense.

09:48.390 --> 09:49.200
Miss Song!

09:50.320 --> 09:50.910
Miss...

09:50.910 --> 09:51.550
I'm sorry.

09:51.550 --> 09:52.320
Miss Song.

09:54.000 --> 09:55.000
Please calm down.

09:55.200 --> 09:56.200
Please calm down.

09:56.880 --> 09:57.610
Miss Song...

09:58.840 --> 09:59.630
I'm sorry.

10:00.740 --> 10:01.620
I'm sorry!

10:01.980 --> 10:02.990
Miss Song!

10:05.840 --> 10:06.720
The snow is too heavy.

10:06.720 --> 10:07.390
Yimeng,

10:07.390 --> 10:08.360
you should go back.

10:08.360 --> 10:09.120
I know the place;

10:09.120 --> 10:10.120
I can go by myself.

10:10.510 --> 10:11.320
No.

10:11.750 --> 10:13.600
Since I'm already in this world,

10:13.600 --> 10:15.630
I have to stop her from making a mistake.

10:15.630 --> 10:16.440
Otherwise,

10:17.000 --> 10:19.060
I'll regret it for the rest of my life.

10:45.720 --> 10:46.390
Miss Song!

10:46.550 --> 10:47.270
Miss Song!

10:47.480 --> 10:49.150
If you don't want to marry Nan Rui, there are plenty of ways.

10:49.150 --> 10:50.240
You don't have to go down this path

10:50.240 --> 10:51.600
and ruin your reputation.

10:51.600 --> 10:52.240
Without Nan Rui,

10:52.240 --> 10:54.030
my mother would make me marry someone else.

10:54.030 --> 10:55.510
I want the whole world to know

10:55.510 --> 10:57.000
that I'm an immoral woman.

10:57.000 --> 10:58.720
That way, from the emperor to commoners,

10:58.720 --> 10:59.840
no one will be able to control me anymore!

10:59.840 --> 11:00.390
I'm sorry!

11:00.390 --> 11:01.080
Don't!

11:01.080 --> 11:01.840
Wait.

11:01.870 --> 11:03.440
You said you liked me,

11:03.440 --> 11:04.000
but you don't

11:04.000 --> 11:05.000
even show the basic respect—

11:05.000 --> 11:05.910
how can that be called liking?

11:05.910 --> 11:07.240
I really have no other choice.

11:07.240 --> 11:07.600
Don't!

11:07.600 --> 11:08.080
I'm sorry!

11:08.080 --> 11:08.880
Please don't!

11:23.350 --> 11:24.570
Seventh Prince?

11:24.920 --> 11:26.170
Why is it you?

11:30.080 --> 11:30.480
It's...

11:30.480 --> 11:31.910
It's not what you think.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.510
My sister's carriage is here.

11:34.510 --> 11:35.150
Hurry!

11:36.970 --> 11:38.040
Song Yimeng?

11:45.840 --> 11:47.350
If Song Yimeng sees this,

11:47.670 --> 11:49.800
she'll never speak to Li Shiliu again.

11:53.280 --> 11:55.740
[Zijin Pavilion]

12:09.790 --> 12:12.190
Is my private business that entertaining?

12:13.460 --> 12:14.270
Get out!

12:23.080 --> 12:25.760
[Zijin Pavilion]

12:27.370 --> 12:29.530
[Song Residence]

12:29.670 --> 12:30.840
In my whole life,

12:31.000 --> 12:33.440
I only hope Yiting can marry into a good family.

12:33.050 --> 12:34.250
[Still Waters Run Deep]

12:33.840 --> 12:34.630
But in the end,

12:34.630 --> 12:36.020
her reputation was ruined

12:36.020 --> 12:37.400
by the Seventh Prince!

12:37.450 --> 12:38.550
Honey,

12:38.750 --> 12:40.880
you can't just stand by and do nothing.

12:42.460 --> 12:43.730
Honey,

12:44.780 --> 12:46.980
we mustn't panic first.

12:47.770 --> 12:50.130
This whole thing seems suspicious.

12:50.220 --> 12:52.350
The Seventh Prince hasn't said a word.

12:52.820 --> 12:54.440
We should at least wait for Yiting to wake up

12:54.440 --> 12:56.480
and hear what she has to say before making any decisions.

12:56.480 --> 12:57.600
What are you waiting for?

12:57.600 --> 12:58.960
Waiting for Yiting to tell you herself

12:58.960 --> 13:00.440
how that Seventh Prince tricked her

13:00.440 --> 13:02.910
with filthy tactics?

13:03.080 --> 13:04.630
Song Yude, listen to me.

13:04.630 --> 13:06.840
I've lowered myself for you all my life

13:06.840 --> 13:08.480
and endured every hardship.

13:08.480 --> 13:09.000
You...

13:09.000 --> 13:10.720
But now I live

13:10.720 --> 13:12.000
only for this daughter.

13:12.000 --> 13:14.480
If you dare let Yiting marry that Seventh Prince,

13:14.480 --> 13:15.270
I...

13:15.750 --> 13:17.280
I'll fight you to the death!

13:20.550 --> 13:21.480
When did I ever say I was going to

13:21.480 --> 13:23.540
let Yiting marry the Seventh Prince?

13:25.240 --> 13:27.480
Let Yiting become a concubine to Yimeng's husband?

13:27.480 --> 13:28.270
You...

13:28.360 --> 13:29.120
You're...

13:29.120 --> 13:30.910
You're completely absurd!

13:31.390 --> 13:32.720
Master, Madam,

13:33.120 --> 13:36.320
the Seventh Prince's Xuanjia Army has broken into the residence.

13:36.320 --> 13:37.120
What?

13:41.510 --> 13:42.510
Stop right there.

13:43.150 --> 13:44.630
Mr. Song, Mrs. Song.

13:45.750 --> 13:47.080
What exactly are you trying to do

13:47.080 --> 13:48.720
by barging into my residence?

13:48.720 --> 13:49.440
Don't get us wrong.

13:49.440 --> 13:50.440
His Highness said

13:50.910 --> 13:51.670
that today

13:51.670 --> 13:53.910
Miss Yimeng and Miss Song Yiting encountered villains in the mountains

13:53.910 --> 13:55.000
and were frightened.

13:54.820 --> 13:57.540
[Persistence]

13:55.120 --> 13:57.510
This concerns the safety of Song Residence.

13:57.510 --> 13:58.910
His Highness ordered me to bring some troops

13:58.910 --> 14:00.240
to protect the security of Song Residence.

14:00.240 --> 14:01.150
Nonsense!

14:01.180 --> 14:02.040
What villains?

14:02.210 --> 14:03.800
[Persistence]

14:02.290 --> 14:03.940
This is clearly the Seventh Prince's…

14:03.940 --> 14:04.910
Where is the Seventh Prince?

14:04.910 --> 14:05.840
I want to see him!

14:06.120 --> 14:06.630
Well...

14:07.480 --> 14:08.480
His Highness said

14:08.720 --> 14:09.870
that he will explain all arrangements for tonight

14:09.870 --> 14:11.390
when he meets His Majesty tomorrow.

14:11.390 --> 14:12.790
And he will definitely give an account to Miss Song

14:12.790 --> 14:14.030
and the Song family.

14:14.030 --> 14:16.030
Some matters grow complicated with delay.

14:16.030 --> 14:17.000
There are many eyes

14:17.000 --> 14:18.020
and tongues in the capital.

14:18.020 --> 14:19.030
His Highness is doing this

14:19.030 --> 14:20.720
to protect Miss Yiting's reputation.

14:20.300 --> 14:23.050
[Persistence]

14:20.790 --> 14:21.440
You're...

14:21.440 --> 14:23.150
You're threatening me.

14:24.000 --> 14:24.840
I dare not.

14:25.200 --> 14:26.000
Let's go.

14:26.390 --> 14:27.250
What are you...

14:27.750 --> 14:28.550
Honey!

14:30.200 --> 14:31.000
You... you...

14:46.710 --> 14:47.500
Move.

14:48.140 --> 14:53.110
[Xiyue Pavilion]

14:48.870 --> 14:50.000
I said move!

14:50.000 --> 14:50.790
Song Yimeng.

14:53.670 --> 14:54.480
Nan Heng,

14:53.740 --> 14:55.630
[Xiyue Pavilion]

14:54.910 --> 14:56.150
this is Song Residence,

14:56.150 --> 14:58.210
not a place for you to do as you please.

15:07.910 --> 15:08.720
I'm sorry.

15:11.630 --> 15:12.440
You're sorry?

15:14.320 --> 15:15.120
Nan Heng,

15:16.120 --> 15:18.580
don't you think you're being hypocritical?

15:19.600 --> 15:20.650
The method of weapon forging,

15:20.650 --> 15:21.630
the crown prince position,

15:21.630 --> 15:22.320
the script rule—

15:22.320 --> 15:23.270
what else do you want to know?

15:23.270 --> 15:24.510
I can tell you everything.

15:24.510 --> 15:26.000
But what did Song Yiting do wrong?

15:26.000 --> 15:26.910
Why did you harm

15:26.910 --> 15:28.080
an innocent person?

15:28.390 --> 15:30.000
I never meant to harm her.

15:30.390 --> 15:31.550
And everything I'm doing now

15:31.550 --> 15:33.150
is an attempt to make amends.

15:33.630 --> 15:34.440
Make amends?

15:34.960 --> 15:36.030
How?

15:36.200 --> 15:38.240
[Xiyue Pavilion]

15:36.910 --> 15:38.390
By having your Xuanjia Army

15:38.390 --> 15:40.030
imprison everyone

15:40.150 --> 15:41.740
in the Song family?

15:42.570 --> 15:44.590
It's not like what you think.

15:44.630 --> 15:46.030
Can't you trust me just once?

15:46.030 --> 15:47.390
Not even once?

15:47.700 --> 15:48.900
Seeing is believing.

15:49.220 --> 15:54.320
[Xiyue Pavilion]

15:52.480 --> 15:55.030
Your Highness, what else do you want Yimeng to believe?

15:55.030 --> 15:56.720
Why are you everywhere?

15:56.790 --> 15:58.800
You keep deceiving Yimeng again and again.

15:58.800 --> 16:01.150
How can anyone trust that you'll treat her well?

16:01.150 --> 16:02.150
From today on,

16:02.460 --> 16:04.260
I won't stand by and watch.

16:04.790 --> 16:07.000
And I absolutely won't let Yimeng marry you.

16:07.000 --> 16:08.320
This is between me and Song Yimeng.

16:08.320 --> 16:10.080
What right do you, an outsider, have to interfere?

16:10.080 --> 16:10.840
Outsider?

16:11.480 --> 16:12.720
What about my aunt's murder?

16:12.720 --> 16:14.450
Is that none of my business too?

16:14.600 --> 16:16.430
I've regretted it for 19 years.

16:16.720 --> 16:17.510
Today,

16:17.840 --> 16:20.170
I will never let you harm my beloved again.

16:21.600 --> 16:23.800
I will reclaim my engagement to Yimeng,

16:24.080 --> 16:24.870
and you

16:25.720 --> 16:27.270
will pay the price.

16:29.240 --> 16:32.040
You can slander me for causing Her Majesty's death

16:32.110 --> 16:34.440
or for trying to seduce Song Yiting,

16:35.030 --> 16:36.200
but let me tell you,

16:36.580 --> 16:38.780
you will never reclaim your engagement

16:38.960 --> 16:40.350
to Song Yimeng.

16:40.440 --> 16:40.840
You...

16:40.840 --> 16:41.550
Enough!

16:42.910 --> 16:44.000
Stop it.

16:46.720 --> 16:47.510
Nan Heng,

16:48.000 --> 16:50.840
your scheming to form a marriage alliance with the Song family

16:50.840 --> 16:53.270
by any means necessary is just to expand your power.

16:53.270 --> 16:55.000
Why are you putting on this act?

16:55.840 --> 16:56.630
General Chu,

16:57.150 --> 16:58.210
you should go back.

16:58.670 --> 17:00.200
You don't need to interfere

17:00.320 --> 17:01.510
with the Song family's matters.

17:01.510 --> 17:02.150
Yimeng...

17:02.150 --> 17:03.610
I'm telling you to go back.

17:11.010 --> 17:13.650
[Xiyue Pavilion]

17:15.920 --> 17:16.480
Song Yimeng...

17:16.480 --> 17:18.030
If your Xuanjia Army is still at Song Residence

17:18.030 --> 17:20.400
when Song Yiting wakes tomorrow,

17:21.400 --> 17:23.200
don't blame me for being harsh.

17:28.950 --> 17:34.690
[Xiyue Pavilion]

17:40.480 --> 17:42.750
[Capital Prefecture's Office]

17:49.070 --> 17:49.710
Say it!

17:51.750 --> 17:52.950
Will you say it or not?

17:56.110 --> 17:56.920
Enough.

17:58.280 --> 18:00.070
I will personally interrogate him.

18:00.070 --> 18:00.880
Yes.

18:14.560 --> 18:16.950
Qianyu Army fights on the battlefield

18:17.370 --> 18:19.230
and is not good at interrogation.

18:20.550 --> 18:23.080
I am somewhat acquainted with Mr. Shangguan.

18:23.610 --> 18:24.440
I will ask you

18:24.640 --> 18:25.990
three questions directly,

18:25.990 --> 18:27.520
and you answer truthfully.

18:27.720 --> 18:28.510
Agreed?

18:31.470 --> 18:33.470
That depends on whether I'm willing

18:33.880 --> 18:35.620
to answer your questions.

18:48.650 --> 18:50.580
In the winter of the first year of Xiyuan,

18:50.580 --> 18:53.390
the Seventh Prince Nan Heng led

18:53.410 --> 18:55.430
Xuanjia Army south by imperial order

18:55.430 --> 18:57.880
to investigate a theft case involving three prefectures.

18:57.880 --> 18:58.810
The ringleader,

18:59.440 --> 19:01.030
Shangguan Baihe,

19:01.490 --> 19:04.220
was executed seven days after being imprisoned.

19:09.340 --> 19:12.540
This is what's recorded in the Ministry of Justice files.

19:14.110 --> 19:15.510
What I'm curious about is

19:16.070 --> 19:18.240
how Mr. Shangguan managed to escape

19:18.880 --> 19:21.880
from the heavily guarded celestial prison?

19:22.070 --> 19:23.930
Was it the Seventh Prince Nan Heng

19:24.310 --> 19:26.310
who helped you?

19:27.080 --> 19:28.690
Not long after you escaped,

19:28.850 --> 19:31.000
you appeared in Waning River Crescent.

19:31.000 --> 19:32.070
You and Li Shiliu

19:32.470 --> 19:34.130
are both working for Nan Heng.

19:34.440 --> 19:37.030
Is he running Waning River Crescent with great effort

19:37.030 --> 19:38.750
to secure the succession?

19:43.550 --> 19:44.350
Yes.

19:45.240 --> 19:46.590
But not entirely.

19:51.330 --> 19:52.330
What do you mean?

19:54.150 --> 19:55.710
It is for the succession,

19:55.790 --> 19:57.740
but not for himself—

19:58.040 --> 19:59.200
it's for

20:01.780 --> 20:03.870
the Eighteenth Prince.

20:04.440 --> 20:06.430
The power behind Waning River Crescent

20:06.430 --> 20:08.390
is the Eighteenth Prince,

20:08.530 --> 20:09.920
Nan Rui.

20:15.590 --> 20:16.550
How dare you!

20:20.960 --> 20:22.720
Falsely accusing a prince

20:23.290 --> 20:25.490
is a serious crime punishable by exile.

20:26.810 --> 20:28.270
I'm telling the truth.

20:28.270 --> 20:29.930
How is that false accusation?

20:32.210 --> 20:33.300
I see.

20:33.720 --> 20:36.580
You've never gotten along with the Seventh Prince.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.240
And everyone in Qianyu Army

20:38.240 --> 20:40.590
follows the Eighteenth Prince's lead.

20:40.910 --> 20:44.110
Are you trying to use me as a pawn

20:44.380 --> 20:45.980
to frame the Seventh Prince?

20:48.500 --> 20:50.030
You should've just said so.

20:50.890 --> 20:52.520
If you promise to release me,

20:52.540 --> 20:54.550
I'll go with you to His Majesty

20:54.570 --> 20:56.220
and slander Nan Heng.

20:56.960 --> 20:57.820
What do you say?

21:01.330 --> 21:03.440
Our general wants the truth.

21:03.800 --> 21:05.270
If you keep talking nonsense,

21:05.270 --> 21:07.080
I'll beat your teeth out!

21:08.440 --> 21:09.830
No matter whether I cooperate with you

21:09.830 --> 21:11.510
or not, you're never satisfied.

21:11.510 --> 21:12.440
Mr. Chu,

21:13.110 --> 21:15.160
what exactly do you want?

21:15.750 --> 21:16.720
I'm telling you,

21:17.090 --> 21:18.370
cases involving princes

21:18.370 --> 21:19.720
must be jointly investigated and tried

21:19.720 --> 21:21.180
by the Three Departments.

21:21.720 --> 21:23.270
So I'll need to testify

21:23.270 --> 21:24.440
before His Majesty?

21:26.410 --> 21:27.210
What if

21:27.710 --> 21:30.050
I suddenly change my statement there,

21:30.330 --> 21:32.910
saying you, Chu Guihong, forced me to confess falsely

21:32.910 --> 21:34.640
and framed the Seventh Prince?

21:35.520 --> 21:37.320
What would happen to you

21:37.720 --> 21:39.040
and your Qianyu Army?

21:50.130 --> 21:51.460
Keep a close watch on him

21:52.120 --> 21:53.980
and wait for His Majesty's decree

21:54.240 --> 21:55.510
to execute him.

21:57.160 --> 21:57.960
General.

22:11.640 --> 22:12.440
General,

22:12.780 --> 22:14.920
are we really going to let him die so easily?

22:14.920 --> 22:15.640
How about

22:15.640 --> 22:17.440
I find some torturers

22:17.550 --> 22:18.830
to interrogate him again?

22:18.830 --> 22:19.640
No need.

22:21.000 --> 22:23.030
Shangguan He is already a useless pawn.

22:23.030 --> 22:25.160
No amount of torture will change that.

22:25.640 --> 22:27.510
So we're just letting it go?

22:28.680 --> 22:30.190
Even a useless pawn can be useful.

22:30.190 --> 22:32.120
Let's set a chain trap for Nan Heng.

22:32.950 --> 22:34.120
A chain trap?

22:35.210 --> 22:36.410
General, you mean...

22:37.370 --> 22:39.020
Shangguan Baihe's capture

22:39.090 --> 22:41.820
has proven Nan Heng's failure to handle the case.

22:42.470 --> 22:45.140
Once we review all the records

22:45.240 --> 22:48.240
and find the executioners from that day for questioning,

22:48.240 --> 22:49.300
we'll know exactly

22:49.640 --> 22:51.970
where the tampering occurred.

22:52.640 --> 22:53.720
But what if Nan Heng

22:54.070 --> 22:56.000
has covered his tracks perfectly?

22:57.050 --> 22:59.450
Then we'll pass this hot potato to him—

22:59.470 --> 23:00.920
let him investigate it himself

23:00.920 --> 23:02.320
and prove his innocence.

23:02.550 --> 23:04.150
If he protects Shangguan He,

23:04.240 --> 23:05.750
we can trace his connections

23:05.750 --> 23:06.830
and charge him.

23:07.250 --> 23:09.400
If he tries to sacrifice his right-hand man to save himself,

23:09.400 --> 23:10.810
we can take the opportunity

23:10.810 --> 23:13.020
to weaken him.

23:15.880 --> 23:17.180
If Shangguan He

23:17.480 --> 23:18.940
really works for Nan Heng,

23:19.250 --> 23:21.110
then the entire Waning River Crescent,

23:21.110 --> 23:23.430
including the highly skilled Li Shiliu,

23:23.580 --> 23:25.030
are all his accomplices.

23:26.050 --> 23:28.360
Given Waning River Crescent's ways,

23:28.640 --> 23:30.970
they won't just stand by and watch him die.

23:32.160 --> 23:33.070
By then,

23:33.200 --> 23:35.550
we can use this useless pawn as bait

23:36.030 --> 23:38.110
to lure Waning River Crescent into a trap

23:38.110 --> 23:39.830
and completely crush Nan Heng's faction's

23:39.830 --> 23:41.430
influence among the people,

23:41.500 --> 23:43.300
driving Nan Heng into a dead end.

23:49.820 --> 23:54.000
[Xiyue Pavilion]

23:52.200 --> 23:52.880
My Lady,

23:52.880 --> 23:54.310
there's still no sound from inside.

23:54.310 --> 23:55.550
You haven't slept all night.

23:55.550 --> 23:57.350
Let's wait in your room instead.

24:01.720 --> 24:02.510
Madam.

24:03.070 --> 24:04.350
Are you happy now?

24:05.440 --> 24:07.110
Stop pretending to care.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.830
If it weren't for your improper behavior

24:08.830 --> 24:10.680
and entanglement with Seventh Prince,

24:10.680 --> 24:12.000
would the entire Song family

24:12.000 --> 24:13.240
be in such a mess?

24:13.590 --> 24:14.480
Your sister's life

24:14.480 --> 24:16.440
has been ruined by you.

24:17.000 --> 24:18.310
Madam, please don't worry.

24:18.310 --> 24:19.350
About Yiting,

24:19.830 --> 24:21.350
I'll figure something out.

24:21.350 --> 24:22.400
Figure something out?

24:22.400 --> 24:23.200
What exactly are you going to figure out?

24:23.200 --> 24:23.930
Song Yimeng,

24:24.240 --> 24:26.510
I've never neglected your needs since you were a child, right?

24:26.510 --> 24:28.720
So why are you such a curse on this family?

24:28.720 --> 24:30.240
Are you trying to get the entire family killed

24:30.240 --> 24:31.110
before you're satisfied?

24:31.110 --> 24:32.590
Madam, how can you say that?

24:32.590 --> 24:34.440
Our lady truly cares for Miss Yiting.

24:34.440 --> 24:36.070
How could she ever harm her?

24:36.070 --> 24:36.640
Besides, she...

24:36.640 --> 24:37.640
Am I wrong?

24:37.830 --> 24:39.480
Look at all the soldiers in the courtyard,

24:39.480 --> 24:41.850
and think about how your father defied imperial orders for you.

24:41.850 --> 24:42.880
Song Yimeng,

24:43.070 --> 24:44.350
if one day

24:44.440 --> 24:46.840
the Song family is wiped out because of you,

24:46.850 --> 24:48.710
I'll haunt you even as a ghost!

24:54.980 --> 24:58.900
[A Dream of Qingning
Scene 29, Episode 38]

25:09.160 --> 25:13.130
[A Dream of Qingning
Scene 29, Episode 38]

25:12.110 --> 25:13.970
What exactly are you looking for?

25:15.280 --> 25:17.290
The method of weapon forging.

25:29.000 --> 25:29.830
How is she?

25:29.940 --> 25:30.740
Madam,

25:30.860 --> 25:31.690
Miss Yimeng.

25:33.160 --> 25:34.020
Miss Yiting...

25:34.550 --> 25:36.610
only wants to see the Seventh Prince.

25:45.040 --> 25:47.970
[Song Residence]

25:50.920 --> 25:51.920
Nan Heng!

25:51.920 --> 25:52.550
I...

25:54.860 --> 25:56.190
Are you even human?

25:59.520 --> 26:00.920
I don't have time for you.

26:01.320 --> 26:02.170
Nan Heng,

26:02.190 --> 26:02.960
how could you...

26:02.960 --> 26:04.090
Eighteenth Prince,

26:04.340 --> 26:05.940
we are on the street.

26:05.960 --> 26:06.990
Please stay calm

26:07.030 --> 26:08.240
for Miss Yiting.

26:08.870 --> 26:09.590
I...

26:09.590 --> 26:10.480
Stay calm?

26:10.500 --> 26:11.310
I...

26:12.070 --> 26:13.010
Nan Heng,

26:13.030 --> 26:14.110
both you and that Li Shiliu

26:14.110 --> 26:15.400
are no good!

26:15.420 --> 26:16.920
I will definitely avenge Yiting!

26:16.920 --> 26:18.520
Just wait for your downfall!

26:27.090 --> 26:29.370
If you want to know who Li Shiliu is

26:29.590 --> 26:31.070
and keep him safe and sound,

26:31.070 --> 26:33.270
come see me first thing when you wake up.

26:33.430 --> 26:34.390
Seventh Prince,

26:34.410 --> 26:35.460
well played.

26:40.250 --> 26:43.920
[One day ago]

26:42.750 --> 26:44.110
Is His Highness inside?

26:44.130 --> 26:45.370
What happened?

26:55.240 --> 26:56.000
Come.

26:57.110 --> 26:57.750
Yiting.

26:58.240 --> 26:59.000
Yiting?

26:59.720 --> 27:01.140
Why did she pass out?

27:01.440 --> 27:03.110
What did you do to her?

27:03.750 --> 27:05.660
Your sister encountered mountain bandits

27:05.660 --> 27:06.920
and fainted from fear.

27:07.370 --> 27:08.540
Jerk.

27:08.590 --> 27:09.440
Let's go!

27:15.270 --> 27:16.130
Your Highness!

27:17.000 --> 27:18.240
What exactly happened?

27:18.240 --> 27:18.790
You...

27:18.790 --> 27:20.050
What's wrong with you?

27:20.160 --> 27:20.960
I'm fine.

27:21.480 --> 27:22.590
I was drugged.

27:24.640 --> 27:25.830
Go inside and clean up the mess.

27:25.830 --> 27:26.960
Take the blade away.

27:27.400 --> 27:28.440
Seal off all news

27:29.460 --> 27:32.260
and deploy troops to surround the Song Residence.

27:34.070 --> 27:36.110
You sealed off the news, surrounded Song Residence,

27:36.110 --> 27:38.350
and even slipped a note into my clothes.

27:39.590 --> 27:41.550
Your Highness, what exactly

27:41.920 --> 27:43.350
are you scheming?

27:44.000 --> 27:44.830
And also,

27:45.000 --> 27:47.070
who exactly is Li Shiliu?

27:48.640 --> 27:49.440
Actually,

27:50.590 --> 27:52.270
since you were provoked by the Axe Gang

27:52.270 --> 27:54.030
at Waning River Crescent,

27:54.830 --> 27:56.630
the Li Shiliu you've been seeing

27:57.400 --> 27:59.060
has always been Shangguan He.

28:00.150 --> 28:01.230
Shangguan He?

28:02.940 --> 28:04.090
That's impossible.

28:04.310 --> 28:05.790
He's just a pervert.

28:05.810 --> 28:07.540
How could he possibly be Mr. Li?

28:10.770 --> 28:11.770
Miss Song,

28:12.640 --> 28:13.750
this Li Shiliu

28:13.880 --> 28:15.480
is another identity of mine.

28:16.000 --> 28:17.630
Shangguan He happened

28:17.680 --> 28:19.790
to meet you under this identity.

28:20.310 --> 28:21.270
I didn't want to interfere

28:21.270 --> 28:23.000
in this matter between you two.

28:23.440 --> 28:25.000
Yesterday I went to Zijin Pavilion

28:25.000 --> 28:26.600
because he asked me

28:27.640 --> 28:29.960
to return these paintings to you.

28:30.830 --> 28:31.930
But I didn't expect

28:32.310 --> 28:33.830
what happened afterward.

28:40.730 --> 28:42.670
Your identity must remain secret,

28:42.870 --> 28:45.740
so you sent the Xuanjia Army to the Song Residence,

28:45.930 --> 28:48.410
hoping to explain everything to me first.

28:51.110 --> 28:51.920
Yes.

28:54.550 --> 28:56.450
Seventh Prince, well played.

28:56.960 --> 28:57.960
But today,

28:57.960 --> 28:59.240
the one who should be talking to me

28:59.240 --> 29:00.270
is not you.

29:01.130 --> 29:02.450
Where is Shangguan He?

29:03.090 --> 29:05.820
Doesn't he even have the courage to explain to me?

29:08.480 --> 29:09.590
He is currently

29:10.750 --> 29:13.350
in the prison of capital prefecture's office.

29:18.550 --> 29:20.990
[Blossoms in Spring, Fruits in Autumn]

29:26.880 --> 29:27.680
Move!

29:27.730 --> 29:30.600
[Xiyue Pavilion]

29:28.070 --> 29:28.880
No, no, no!

29:29.000 --> 29:29.920
Please calm down, Mrs. Song.

29:29.920 --> 29:30.680
Let me in.

29:30.720 --> 29:32.920
His Highness did this for a reason.

29:32.960 --> 29:34.440
He will certainly give you an explanation.

29:34.440 --> 29:35.290
What explanation?

29:35.290 --> 29:37.110
That he wants to marry our Yiting?

29:37.110 --> 29:38.240
Should I just let his wolfish ambitions

29:38.240 --> 29:39.960
drag Yiting into the fire?

29:40.310 --> 29:41.890
How can you say that about His Highness?

29:41.890 --> 29:44.030
If it weren't for Miss Yiting poisoning the incense burner,

29:44.030 --> 29:45.830
would His Highness be like this?

29:46.440 --> 29:48.380
What nonsense are you talking about?

29:48.380 --> 29:50.030
How could our Yiting do such a thing?

29:50.030 --> 29:51.240
It's clearly that Nan Heng...

29:51.240 --> 29:53.750
It was your Miss Yiting who wanted to frame His Highness.

29:53.750 --> 29:55.000
If you don't believe me,

29:55.000 --> 29:56.830
Xuanjia Army has already brought back the incense burner

29:56.830 --> 29:57.510
from Zijin Pavilion.

29:57.510 --> 29:58.680
I'll take you to see it right now.

29:58.680 --> 29:59.680
Shut up!

29:59.700 --> 30:01.640
His Highness just wants to calm things down.

30:01.640 --> 30:02.640
Why do you

30:02.640 --> 30:03.880
keep causing trouble here?

30:03.880 --> 30:05.030
You shameless scoundrel!

30:05.030 --> 30:06.310
Trying to blame the victim, are you?

30:06.310 --> 30:07.000
Fine.

30:07.000 --> 30:08.790
Today I'll shut you up for good!

30:13.270 --> 30:14.070
Fugui!

30:13.410 --> 30:14.580
[Xiyue Pavilion]

30:14.110 --> 30:15.070
How dare you act recklessly?

30:15.070 --> 30:15.590
I...

30:15.590 --> 30:16.640
I didn't act recklessly.

30:16.640 --> 30:17.880
His Highness ordered us

30:17.880 --> 30:19.590
not to fight back or talk back.

30:19.590 --> 30:20.400
I wouldn't dare disobey.

30:20.400 --> 30:21.030
You!

30:21.160 --> 30:21.680
Let's go,

30:21.680 --> 30:22.400
Madam.

30:26.590 --> 30:27.680
The women in Song Residence

30:27.680 --> 30:29.080
are all quite something,

30:29.270 --> 30:31.160
and His Highness still gets entangled with them.

30:31.160 --> 30:33.020
Isn't he just asking for trouble?

30:33.240 --> 30:34.590
You two, master and servant,

30:34.590 --> 30:36.190
have played me like a fiddle,

30:36.350 --> 30:38.610
and now you want me to help hide the truth.

30:38.680 --> 30:39.500
Your Highness,

30:39.500 --> 30:41.360
why do you think I'd agree to that?

30:42.590 --> 30:44.110
Shangguan He told me once

30:45.350 --> 30:47.160
that your knowledge and talent

30:47.240 --> 30:48.590
surpass most women.

30:49.400 --> 30:50.950
Since you've read history,

30:51.240 --> 30:52.810
you should know the lessons of the past.

30:52.810 --> 30:54.310
Since you're good at chess,

30:54.310 --> 30:56.570
you should understand gains and losses.

30:58.320 --> 30:59.840
You said all this

30:59.880 --> 31:01.550
just to warn me

31:02.500 --> 31:04.260
that revealing your identity

31:04.280 --> 31:05.880
will only make things worse,

31:06.710 --> 31:09.510
that I'd get the reputation of seducing my brother-in-law,

31:09.510 --> 31:12.110
and that Yimeng would become a laughingstock.

31:12.140 --> 31:12.930
This benefits

31:12.930 --> 31:13.960
neither me

31:14.030 --> 31:15.160
nor the Song family.

31:18.000 --> 31:19.880
As long as you understand this,

31:19.880 --> 31:22.690
I will immediately withdraw my men from Song Residence.

31:22.690 --> 31:24.270
And you can rest assured.

31:24.440 --> 31:25.070
I've already sealed off

31:25.070 --> 31:26.590
the news about last night.

31:26.640 --> 31:28.620
Absolutely no one will know about it.

31:28.620 --> 31:30.610
I'll also do my best to help

31:30.960 --> 31:32.430
with your marriage arrangements

31:32.430 --> 31:33.440
as compensation.

31:36.020 --> 31:37.650
What makes you think

31:38.370 --> 31:39.410
this is enough?

31:43.590 --> 31:44.790
What else do you want?

31:46.200 --> 31:47.270
I want Shangguan He

31:47.550 --> 31:48.750
to be safe and sound.

31:53.720 --> 31:54.750
Yimeng once said

31:55.030 --> 31:56.000
you're ruthless

31:56.000 --> 31:57.590
and far from a decent person.

31:57.590 --> 31:59.650
Now that Shangguan He's been exposed,

31:59.650 --> 32:01.240
if you don't step forward and take responsibility,

32:01.240 --> 32:02.790
this won't end well.

32:03.510 --> 32:04.270
But you

32:04.270 --> 32:05.830
will never expose Waning River Crescent

32:05.830 --> 32:07.160
or give up your power.

32:09.240 --> 32:12.240
Are you planning to sacrifice the pawn to save the king,

32:12.240 --> 32:14.240
keeping yourself clean of all this?

32:20.400 --> 32:22.200
Miss Song, you're indeed smart.

32:23.850 --> 32:25.030
But you don't need

32:25.640 --> 32:27.300
to worry about these matters.

32:28.010 --> 32:29.160
Whether smart

32:29.190 --> 32:30.470
or foolish,

32:30.680 --> 32:32.530
we're all just mortals.

32:32.560 --> 32:35.050
A person must have some backbone.

32:36.200 --> 32:37.000
I admit

32:37.360 --> 32:39.990
every word you said before was right.

32:40.510 --> 32:41.790
The pros and cons,

32:41.880 --> 32:43.010
the risks and gains—

32:43.270 --> 32:44.530
I understand them all.

32:44.960 --> 32:45.750
But

32:45.790 --> 32:47.790
I just don't want to comply with you.

32:48.420 --> 32:49.850
Rescue Shangguan He,

32:49.950 --> 32:51.190
apologize to Yimeng,

32:51.960 --> 32:53.440
and never marry another woman

32:53.440 --> 32:55.590
besides her in your life.

32:56.100 --> 32:58.370
If you fail at either,

32:58.680 --> 32:59.720
don't blame me

32:59.720 --> 33:01.320
for exposing your identity.

33:08.160 --> 33:09.690
You dare threaten me?

33:13.660 --> 33:14.760
Aren't you afraid I'll...

33:14.760 --> 33:15.850
If I die,

33:16.030 --> 33:17.760
Yimeng will never forgive you.

33:17.830 --> 33:18.960
On that alone,

33:19.000 --> 33:20.130
I bet you don't dare.

33:24.240 --> 33:25.030
Fine.

33:27.880 --> 33:29.000
It's a deal.

33:29.700 --> 33:35.830
[Song Residence]

33:47.010 --> 33:51.730
[Token]

33:47.200 --> 33:48.510
The capital prefecture's office is handling a case,

33:48.510 --> 33:49.960
and there is important information.

33:49.960 --> 33:52.590
Seventh Prince, please come to the office with me for a discussion.

33:52.590 --> 33:54.250
What important information?

33:54.960 --> 33:57.510
The capital prefecture's office has the authority to interrogate.

33:57.510 --> 33:58.550
Any defiance

33:58.980 --> 34:01.040
will be treated as a serious offense.

34:06.830 --> 34:08.830
Who dares disrespect His Highness!

34:08.920 --> 34:09.710
It's fine.

34:11.710 --> 34:14.400
I haven't been to the capital prefecture's office since returning to the capital.

34:14.400 --> 34:15.190
Today,

34:15.679 --> 34:17.120
I'll go there with you.

34:30.440 --> 34:31.500
Who is this person?

34:32.139 --> 34:33.510
Your Highness, have you forgotten?

34:33.510 --> 34:35.150
His name is Shangguan He.

34:35.170 --> 34:37.230
You saw him at Waning River Crescent.

34:37.230 --> 34:38.429
Logically speaking,

34:38.550 --> 34:40.949
matters of outlaws shouldn't concern you.

34:41.000 --> 34:42.239
But three years ago,

34:42.580 --> 34:44.880
he was known as Shangguan Baihe—

34:45.380 --> 34:47.909
the ringleader you arrested in the theft case

34:49.570 --> 34:51.969
involving three prefectures in Jiangnan.

34:57.630 --> 35:00.320
I've handled countless cases over the years.

35:01.230 --> 35:02.890
How could I possibly remember

35:03.440 --> 35:04.970
a insignificant prisoner?

35:08.990 --> 35:10.790
According to the Ministry of Justice's records,

35:10.790 --> 35:13.410
Shangguan Baihe was already executed.

35:13.610 --> 35:16.610
Your Highness, as the official in charge of that case,

35:17.280 --> 35:19.010
aren't you curious how someone

35:19.290 --> 35:21.480
who supposedly died three years ago

35:22.290 --> 35:23.890
is now alive?

35:27.350 --> 35:28.940
So you are saying

35:29.670 --> 35:31.880
that I should

35:32.230 --> 35:34.150
watch over every prisoner

35:34.760 --> 35:35.620
I arrest

35:36.230 --> 35:38.160
all the way until their execution?

35:45.620 --> 35:48.100
You can come up with 1000 reasons to deny it.

35:48.480 --> 35:49.280
However,

35:50.440 --> 35:51.920
yesterday, I went to the Secretariat

35:51.920 --> 35:53.450
to check the old case files.

35:53.630 --> 35:55.230
Guess what happened?

35:58.850 --> 36:00.480
The archives caught fire.

36:00.500 --> 36:02.090
All records from those years

36:02.090 --> 36:03.340
were destroyed.

36:05.670 --> 36:06.530
Your Highness,

36:07.720 --> 36:09.180
if you were in my position,

36:09.590 --> 36:12.050
wouldn't you suspect that someone powerful

36:12.860 --> 36:15.210
was pulling the strings behind this case?

36:16.870 --> 36:18.790
Every time you fail,

36:19.030 --> 36:20.890
you blame me.

36:21.480 --> 36:23.700
It was like this during the Pingrong Battle,

36:23.700 --> 36:25.290
and it's still the same now.

36:33.080 --> 36:35.280
It doesn't matter if you don't admit it.

36:40.600 --> 36:43.060
Aren't you skilled at forcing confessions?

36:43.180 --> 36:45.070
Then why don't you ask

36:45.330 --> 36:46.970
Shangguan Baihe

36:46.990 --> 36:49.320
how he came back from the dead?

36:51.440 --> 36:52.970
Oh, and I forgot to tell you—

36:53.410 --> 36:55.030
this case has already been reported to His Majesty.

36:55.030 --> 36:56.400
What I'm doing today

36:56.420 --> 36:58.180
is giving you a chance

36:58.360 --> 37:00.470
to prove you didn't collude with court officials

37:00.470 --> 37:03.050
to falsify the case files.

37:42.420 --> 37:43.500
Catch them!

38:26.440 --> 38:27.190
Your Highness,

38:27.190 --> 38:28.120
are you alright?

38:28.960 --> 38:30.620
Qianyu Army is truly useless.

38:30.920 --> 38:32.800
You can't even keep watch over a prisoner.

38:32.800 --> 38:34.400
Is there any place still safe

38:34.480 --> 38:35.800
in the capital?

38:37.230 --> 38:38.030
Fugui,

38:38.440 --> 38:39.630
go back and lead the troops

38:39.630 --> 38:41.050
to capture the men in black.

38:41.050 --> 38:41.880
Yes.

38:46.200 --> 38:48.670
Seventh Prince, you're known as the God of Death,

38:48.670 --> 38:50.730
yet you were injured by a man in black.

38:51.510 --> 38:53.370
Or were you just faking the injury

38:53.440 --> 38:54.530
to cover up

38:55.030 --> 38:56.670
a prison break?

38:59.360 --> 39:00.590
Even the God of Death

39:02.110 --> 39:04.030
has his limits.

39:05.810 --> 39:06.600
Is that so?

39:07.400 --> 39:08.190
It's a pity.

39:08.960 --> 39:10.340
Looks like

39:11.230 --> 39:13.120
you saved the wrong man.

39:18.070 --> 39:18.880
Put him down!

39:26.000 --> 39:26.590
Oh no!

39:26.590 --> 39:27.990
That's not Shangguan He.

39:32.190 --> 39:33.130
Stop right there!

39:33.130 --> 39:34.380
Arrest them all!

39:45.590 --> 39:46.440
This

39:46.960 --> 39:48.440
is the real Shangguan He.

39:50.320 --> 39:51.840
The ones who just broke into the prison

39:51.840 --> 39:54.360
were Nightwalkers from Waning River Crescent, right?

39:54.360 --> 39:55.230
Too bad.

39:55.630 --> 39:58.490
They're probably surrounded by Rong Hua's men now.

39:58.510 --> 40:00.440
Once Rong Hua captures them,

40:00.960 --> 40:01.890
Seventh Prince,

40:02.440 --> 40:03.550
what do you think about

40:03.550 --> 40:06.030
sentencing them to exile a thousand miles

40:06.030 --> 40:07.890
for the crime of prison breaking?

40:09.590 --> 40:11.440
Sounds good.

40:12.480 --> 40:13.550
But General Chu,

40:15.400 --> 40:17.010
why are you so sure

40:17.150 --> 40:20.150
the prison breakers are Nightwalkers?

40:22.590 --> 40:24.990
I'm really not from Waning River Crescent.

40:26.000 --> 40:27.800
Someone paid me five hundred taels

40:27.800 --> 40:29.590
to lead people to break the prison

40:29.590 --> 40:30.910
and promised

40:31.190 --> 40:33.110
another five hundred after success.

40:33.110 --> 40:34.150
That person

40:34.590 --> 40:36.050
was a Nightwalker, right?

40:37.030 --> 40:38.380
That person never showed up.

40:38.380 --> 40:39.490
A little beggar

40:39.590 --> 40:40.590
handed me the letter

40:40.590 --> 40:42.190
and silver.

40:45.190 --> 40:47.250
You hired people to break the prison?

40:48.080 --> 40:49.880
General Chu, you must be joking.

40:50.040 --> 40:52.130
I'm not Shangguan He's accomplice.

40:52.400 --> 40:54.070
Why would I do that?

40:54.800 --> 40:56.200
I'm just telling you this

40:56.230 --> 40:57.760
to remind you

40:58.320 --> 40:59.190
not to be...

41:00.070 --> 41:01.550
overconfident.

41:05.780 --> 41:06.840
It doesn't matter.

41:07.630 --> 41:09.150
No matter who they are,

41:09.710 --> 41:11.440
they'll only be Nightwalkers

41:12.360 --> 41:13.840
from Waning River Crescent.

41:13.840 --> 41:15.000
Officers, you must be joking.

41:15.000 --> 41:18.120
How could that little beggar be a Nightwalker?

41:19.440 --> 41:20.030
Enough.

41:22.760 --> 41:24.190
I say it is so.

41:24.840 --> 41:26.030
If there's no evidence,

41:26.030 --> 41:27.440
then we'll fabricate it.

41:28.030 --> 41:30.490
Today, Waning River Crescent must be shut down.

41:30.490 --> 41:31.420
Brothers!

41:31.960 --> 41:33.440
Follow me to Waning River Crescent.

41:33.440 --> 41:34.110
Yes!

41:36.230 --> 41:37.590
Framing?

41:38.230 --> 41:39.360
Impressive.

41:39.890 --> 41:40.890
You flatter me.

41:41.260 --> 41:43.610
I've just been dealing with you for so long

41:43.880 --> 41:45.050
that I picked up these tricks.

41:45.050 --> 41:46.210
Now I'm just using

41:46.760 --> 41:48.550
your own methods against you.

41:50.030 --> 41:52.110
Mr. Chu, since you understand this,

41:52.440 --> 41:53.800
do you also know

41:54.190 --> 41:55.030
what the art

41:55.840 --> 41:57.360
of escape means?
